Z||000000||Fieromarksthespot||09-09-2000||10:46 PM||||<BR>Does anybody know the time it starts and address of where it's being held?<P>Thanks||||reg||14
Z||000001||Oreif||09-09-2000||10:56 PM||||Welcome. The Fierorama is at 2111 midwest road in Oakbrook, IL Registration is 9am until noon. The judging and show is noon until 5pm. I don't know where you are coming from but Midwest road is between 22nd street and 56 (Butterfield road) about 1 mile west of route 83. If on 56 (Butterfield) it is called Summit ave. Going south is Midwest going north is Summit. (You want to go south from 56) It is right next to a McDonalds resturaunt on the east side of the street. (registration desk is inside McD's) <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
